coast-inf
=========

This project is a fork of {Shan, Shui}* by Lingdong Huang:
https://github.com/LingDong-/shan-shui-inf

The upstream project is released under the MIT License. Its copyright notice
and licence text are kept unchanged in LICENSE.

upstream/index.html is an unmodified copy of the upstream index.html at commit
9f754d2 (the head of amarashi/shan-shui-inf when this fork started). It is kept
only as the reference for the golden-master tests and must not be edited.

The Perlin noise implementation in upstream/index.html is adapted from p5.js
(src/math/noise.js), which is licensed under the GNU LGPL 2.1. See PLAN.md,
section 3, "Licence note". The code in src/ does not use it: since Phase 2 its
noise comes from the MIT-licensed simplex-noise package.

This fork changes the subject matter from Chinese shan shui landscapes to an
Australian coastal landscape. Changes are described in PLAN.md and the git
history.
